  "slug": "the-family-of-teachers",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/11751_the-family-of-teachers.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "There is a middle school mathematics teacher in Guangzhou named Wu Huihui. She has been a teacher for 29 years. Her grandfather is a famous educator in China, and her father and mother are both teachers and have been engaged in rural education all their lives. More than 30 other members of Teacher Wu’s family are working in education in different cities. Her own daughter is now a teacher. Four generations of the family believe that education is a great cause and it is also their lifelong pursuit."
  ],
  "english_full": "There is a middle school mathematics teacher in Guangzhou named Wu Huihui. She has been a teacher for 29 years. Her grandfather is a famous educator in China, and her father and mother are both teachers and have been engaged in rural education all their lives. More than 30 other members of Teacher Wu’s family are working in education in different cities. Her own daughter is now a teacher. Four generations of the family believe that education is a great cause and it is also their lifelong pursuit.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "В Гуанчжо́у есть наста́вница матема́тики, и́мя ко́торой У Ху́йхуй. Она на́стаивала уже 29 ле́т. Её де́душка — изве́стный наста́вник в Кита́е, а её ба́тюшка и ма́ма оба наста́вники и всю жизнь занима́ются се́льским образова́нием. Бо́лее 30 друго́й членов семьи учи́теля У рабо́тают в образова́нии в друго́их городах. Её до́чка се́йчас наста́вница. Четыре поколе́ния семьи ве́рят, что образова́ние — это великоле́пное де́ло, и это также их пожизненная пого́ня."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "V Gуanchzhо́u yestʹ nastávnitsa matematiki, ímya kotorой U Khу́yhui. Ona nastáivala uzhe 29 let. Eё dédushka — izvéstnyy nastávnik v Kitáye, a eё bátyushka i máma oba nastávniki i vsyu zhiznʹ zanímayutsya sélskimi obrazovániyem. Bóleye 30 druǵikh chlenov sem'i uchitelya U rabotayut v obrazovánii v druǵikh gorodakh. Eё dóchka séychas nastávnitsa. Chetyré pokoleniy sem'i véryat, chto obrazovánie — eto velikolépnoye délo, i eto takzhe ikh pozhiznennaya pogónya."
  ],
